-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 15+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: EN<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 90\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Resident Evil","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"horror","director":"Zach Cregger","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":90,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787571584.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5488":{"id":5488,"title":"W SERCU DZICZY ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/w-sercu-dziczy-2026-09-28-20-00-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","date":"2026-09-30T20:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-30 19:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-30 20:00:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":982,"name":"W SERCU DZICZY ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nFilm ukazuj\u0105cy siln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem, a jego wiernym psim towarzyszem.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Brad Pitt i owczarek niemiecki walcz\u0105 o przetrwanie na dzikich terenach Alaski. Po katastrofie lotniczej w samym sercu dzikiej Alaski do\u015bwiadczony by\u0142y \u017co\u0142nierz si\u0142 specjalnych James Belmont (Brad Pitt) i jego pies bojowy Odin, zostaj\u0105 odci\u0119ci od \u015bwiata zdani wy\u0142\u0105cznie na w\u0142asne umiej\u0119tno\u015bci. Razem musz\u0105 stoczy\u0107 walk\u0119 o przetrwanie w obliczu brutalnych si\u0142 natury.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY, film autorstwa uznanego re\u017cysera Davida Ayera, to intensywny thriller przygodowy, kt\u00f3ry ukazuje nierozerwaln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem a jego najlepszym przyjacielem w obliczu ich najwi\u0119kszej jak dot\u0105d bitwy.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW filmie zobaczymy r\u00f3wnie\u017c laureata Oscara J.K. Simmonsa i Anne Lambe, ale W SERCU DZICZY to w pe\u0142ni film Brada Pitta, pierwszy od prawie dziesi\u0119ciu lat film, w kt\u00f3rym Pitt wyst\u0119puje w roli g\u0142\u00f3wnej bez licznej obsady drugoplanowej.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY to te\u017c ponowne spotkanie re\u017cysera Davida Ayera z Pittem, kt\u00f3rzy wcze\u015bniej pracowali przy dramacie wojennym FURIA z 2014 roku. Ayer uwa\u017ca jednak, \u017ce w nowym filmie Pitt pokazuje si\u0119 z zupe\u0142nie nowej strony: To prawdziwa bestia. By\u0142 wra\u017cliwy i otworzy\u0142 si\u0119 w spos\u00f3b, jakiego jeszcze nie widzia\u0142em. Ludzie, kt\u00f3rzy obejrzeli film, nieustannie podkre\u015blaj\u0105, jak surowa, wiarygodna i g\u0142\u0119boka jest jego rola.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 15+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: EN<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Heart of the Beast","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"thriller","director":"David Ayer","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5497":{"id":5497,"title":"W SERCU DZICZY  - KINO DLA SENIORA","url":"\/kup-bilet\/w-sercu-dziczy-2026-10-01-13-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T13:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 12:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 13:00:00"},"products":[{"id":256,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1500,"price":"15,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}]},"event":{"id":982,"name":"W SERCU DZICZY ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nFilm ukazuj\u0105cy siln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem, a jego wiernym psim towarzyszem.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Brad Pitt i owczarek niemiecki walcz\u0105 o przetrwanie na dzikich terenach Alaski. Po katastrofie lotniczej w samym sercu dzikiej Alaski do\u015bwiadczony by\u0142y \u017co\u0142nierz si\u0142 specjalnych James Belmont (Brad Pitt) i jego pies bojowy Odin, zostaj\u0105 odci\u0119ci od \u015bwiata zdani wy\u0142\u0105cznie na w\u0142asne umiej\u0119tno\u015bci. Razem musz\u0105 stoczy\u0107 walk\u0119 o przetrwanie w obliczu brutalnych si\u0142 natury.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY, film autorstwa uznanego re\u017cysera Davida Ayera, to intensywny thriller przygodowy, kt\u00f3ry ukazuje nierozerwaln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem a jego najlepszym przyjacielem w obliczu ich najwi\u0119kszej jak dot\u0105d bitwy.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW filmie zobaczymy r\u00f3wnie\u017c laureata Oscara J.K. Simmonsa i Anne Lambe, ale W SERCU DZICZY to w pe\u0142ni film Brada Pitta, pierwszy od prawie dziesi\u0119ciu lat film, w kt\u00f3rym Pitt wyst\u0119puje w roli g\u0142\u00f3wnej bez licznej obsady drugoplanowej.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY to te\u017c ponowne spotkanie re\u017cysera Davida Ayera z Pittem, kt\u00f3rzy wcze\u015bniej pracowali przy dramacie wojennym FURIA z 2014 roku. Ayer uwa\u017ca jednak, \u017ce w nowym filmie Pitt pokazuje si\u0119 z zupe\u0142nie nowej strony: To prawdziwa bestia. By\u0142 wra\u017cliwy i otworzy\u0142 si\u0119 w spos\u00f3b, jakiego jeszcze nie widzia\u0142em. Ludzie, kt\u00f3rzy obejrzeli film, nieustannie podkre\u015blaj\u0105, jak surowa, wiarygodna i g\u0142\u0119boka jest jego rola.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 15+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: EN<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Heart of the Beast","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"thriller","director":"David Ayer","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5418":{"id":5418,"title":"DZIE\u0143 DZIECKA KSI\u0118DZA JANA KACZKOWSKIEGO ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/dzien-dziecka-ksiedza-jana-kaczkowskiego-2026-09-14-13-30-6","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787563547.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T16:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":120,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 15:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-24 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 16:00:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":110}]},"event":{"id":975,"name":"DZIE\u0143 DZIECKA KSI\u0118DZA JANA KACZKOWSKIEGO ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKsi\u0105dz Jan Kaczkowski - charyzmatyczny duchowny i zwyk\u0142y b\u0142\u0105dz\u0105cy cz\u0142owiek.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Naznaczony nieuleczaln\u0105 chorob\u0105, samozwa\u0144czy \"onkocelebryta\", kt\u00f3ry walczy\u0142 dla innych o godno\u015b\u0107 i cz\u0142owiecze\u0144stwo. Dzie\u0144 dziecka - diagnoza choroby, wspomnienia z dzieci\u0144stwa, symboliczne narodzenie dla wieczno\u015bci. Metaforyczny termin, kt\u00f3ry w filmie koncentruje uwag\u0119 na mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107. Na mi\u0142o\u015bci do innych ludzi, chorych i pogubionych, na mi\u0142o\u015bci do rodziny, do ojca i do Boga. To tak\u017ce film o potrzebie kochania i bycia kochanym. Skonstruowany z nieznanych archiwali\u00f3w, prawdziwy portret niezwyk\u0142ego cz\u0142owieka.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 12+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: PL<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 75\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dokument, biograficzny","director":"Artur Wierzbicki","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":75,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787563547.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5506":{"id":5506,"title":"50 na 51:  SPIS CUDZO\u0141O\u017bNIC","url":"\/kup-bilet\/50-na-51-2026-10-01-18-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788342288.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T18:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 17:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-02 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 18:00:00"},"products":[{"id":391,"name":"BILET","rawPrice":1600,"price":"16,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}]},"event":{"id":987,"name":"50 na 51: ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nMi\u0142o\u015b\u0107 a transformacja. Portret pokolenia lat 90-tych.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Lata 90-te by\u0142y z dzisiejszej perspektywy okresem szalonej transformacji, w kt\u00f3rej niejeden utraci\u0142 wszystko. Niewa\u017cne, czy w mie\u015bcie, czy na prowincji \u2013 wszystko podlega\u0142o zmianom, kt\u00f3re oddzia\u0142ywa\u0142y na \u00f3wczesne pokolenie. I o tym chcieliby\u015bmy opowiedzie\u0107 podczas naszego przegl\u0105du w ramach 50 na 51 FPFF.<br>\r\nW ramach pokaz\u00f3w b\u0119dzie mo\u017cna zobaczy\u0107 filmy, kt\u00f3re obrazuj\u0105 \u017cycie m\u0142odego cz\u0142owieka pr\u00f3buj\u0105cego odnale\u017a\u0107 w\u0142asn\u0105 to\u017csamo\u015b\u0107 i mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107 w rzeczywisto\u015bci polski lat 90 (\u201eFarba\u201d w re\u017c. M. Rosy), refleksj\u0119 nad polsk\u0105 rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105, pami\u0119ci\u0105 i ludzkimi pragnieniami (\u201eSpis cudzo\u0142o\u017cnic\u201d w re\u017c. J. Stuhra) czy satyryczny portret cz\u0142owieka, kt\u00f3ry w chaosie transformacji ustrojowej pr\u00f3buje znale\u017a\u0107 spos\u00f3b na \u017cycie, balansuj\u0105c mi\u0119dzy zaradno\u015bci\u0105 a \u017cyciowym oportunizmem (\u201eDarmozjad polski\u201d w re\u017c. \u0141. Wyl\u0119\u017ca\u0142ka).<br>\r\nFilmy te s\u0105 ciekawym i wa\u017cnym g\u0142osem polskiej filmografii i w dzisiejszych czasach pi\u0119knie oddaj\u0105 rzeczywisto\u015b\u0107 tamtych lat, osamotnienie jednostki i zagubienie po\u015br\u00f3d meandr\u00f3w szybko zmieniaj\u0105cej si\u0119 rzeczywisto\u015bci, a wszystko niejednokrotnie odziane w opary niespe\u0142nionej lub nigdy nie odnalezionej mi\u0142o\u015bci.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nTerminy:<br> \r\n17.09 | 18:00 | Darmozjad polski<br>\r\n24.09 | 18:00 | Farba<br>\r\n01.10 | 18:00 | Spis cudzo\u0142o\u017cnic<br>\r\n<br>\r\nOrganizatorem \u201e50 na 51\u201d jest Pomorska Fundacja Filmowa w Gdyni \u2013 producent Festiwalu Polskich Film\u00f3w Fabularnych. <br>\r\nProjekt zosta\u0142 obj\u0119ty patronatem honorowym Prezydent Miasta Gdyni.<br> \r\nProjekt dofinansowano ze \u015brodk\u00f3w Ministra Kultury i Dziedzictwa Narodowego oraz Polskiego Instytutu Sztuki Filmowej.<br> \r\nPartnerem g\u0142\u00f3wnym \u201e50 na 51\u201d jest Filmoteka Narodowa \u2013 Instytut \r\nAudiowizualny. <br>\r\nPartnerami projektu s\u0105 Wytw\u00f3rnia Film\u00f3w Dokumentalnych i Fabularnych, \r\nTelewizja Polska oraz Fundacja Kino Dost\u0119pne.<br> \r\nPatronami medialnymi projektu s\u0105 Telewizja Polska, Polska Press Grupa, \r\nnaszemiasto.pl, Program 1 Polskiego Radia, Program 3 Polskiego Radia, Magazyn Filmowy SFP, Ekrany, Interia, Filmweb, Miesi\u0119cznik KINO, Kino Polska.\r\n<\/span><br>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788342288.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"4546":{"id":4546,"title":"Heban Hebanowski w Centralnej ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/heban-hebanowski-w-centralnej-2026-10-01-19-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1772690955.png","date":"2026-10-01T19:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":43,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 18:00:00","startAt":"2026-03-05 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 19:00:00"},"products":[{"id":351,"name":"Centralna","rawPrice":3000,"price":"30,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":43}]},"event":{"id":866,"name":"Heban Hebanowski w Centralnej ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0.5rem; padding: 0px 0px 10px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.2; text-align: left;\">\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\r\n\r\nKolejny fantastyczny koncert w<font color=\"#12731e\"> Centralnej klubokawiarni<\/font> przed nami!\r\n\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n\r\nHeban Hebanowski - artysta zakorzeniony w Krakowie i s\u0142yszany w Bieszczadach (m. in.wielokrotnie go\u015bci\u0142 na Festiwalu Chmielowisko). Wyst\u0119powa\u0142 te\u017c w Katowicach, Wroc\u0142awiu i Warszawie. Jego piosenki zabrzmi\u0105 te\u017c w Pszczynie.<br>\r\nHebanowski od ponad dekady tworzy autorskie piosenki inspirowane codzienno\u015bci\u0105 i histori\u0105, natur\u0105 i miastem. Jego \"kawa\u0142ki heblowane\", czyli \"pios\u0119ki\" cechuj\u0105 oryginalne teksty, zmienne nastroje \u0142\u0105cz\u0105ce nostalgi\u0119 i refleksj\u0119 (nas troje) z humorem i energi\u0105 (kocham ci\u0119), kt\u00f3re dostarcz\u0105j\u0105 osobistych prze\u017cy\u0107.<br>\r\nNagra\u0142 cztery albumy ze swoimi utworami: \u201ctrylogi\u0119 heblowan\u0105\u201d (debiutanckie kawa\u0142ki nieheblowane 2016 i albumy Szary cz\u0142owiek 2017 oraz Przeb\u0142ysk 2018. Ostatnia uko\u0144czona p\u0142yta to \u015acie\u017cki na wsch\u00f3d (c\u0442\u0435\u0436\u043a\u0438 \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0445\u0456\u0434, eastbound 2023).<br>\r\nHebanowski hebluje nie tylko w\u0142asne kawa\u0142ki.<br>\r\nPoza uprawianiem tw\u00f3rczo\u015bci jest te\u017c pasjonatem muzyki tradycyjnej, doktorem (cho\u0107 nie wypisuje recept) i badaczem folkloru miejskiego, a tak\u017ce wsp\u00f3\u0142za\u0142o\u017cycielem kapeli Weso\u0142a Fala Band (muzyka XX-lecia mi\u0119dzywojennego) oraz Mo\u0142odc\u00f3w (m\u0119ska grupa \u015bpiewu tradycyjnego). <br>\r\nPodczas koncertu w Pszczynie zaprezentuje wybrane piosenki (piosenki z s\u0119kiem).<br><br>\r\nZapraszamy!\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n__________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n\r\nBilety: 30 PLN (w dniu koncertu 35 PLN)\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/th>\r\n\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/koncert-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"Koncert","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1772690955.png","artists":[]},"location":{"id":31,"name":"Centralna klubokawiarnia | pckul","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":2,"location_type_name":"otwarte","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5489":{"id":5489,"title":"W SERCU DZICZY ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/w-sercu-dziczy-2026-09-28-20-00-3","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","date":"2026-10-01T20:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-01 19:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-01 20:00:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":982,"name":"W SERCU DZICZY ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nFilm ukazuj\u0105cy siln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem, a jego wiernym psim towarzyszem.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Brad Pitt i owczarek niemiecki walcz\u0105 o przetrwanie na dzikich terenach Alaski. Po katastrofie lotniczej w samym sercu dzikiej Alaski do\u015bwiadczony by\u0142y \u017co\u0142nierz si\u0142 specjalnych James Belmont (Brad Pitt) i jego pies bojowy Odin, zostaj\u0105 odci\u0119ci od \u015bwiata zdani wy\u0142\u0105cznie na w\u0142asne umiej\u0119tno\u015bci. Razem musz\u0105 stoczy\u0107 walk\u0119 o przetrwanie w obliczu brutalnych si\u0142 natury.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY, film autorstwa uznanego re\u017cysera Davida Ayera, to intensywny thriller przygodowy, kt\u00f3ry ukazuje nierozerwaln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem a jego najlepszym przyjacielem w obliczu ich najwi\u0119kszej jak dot\u0105d bitwy.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW filmie zobaczymy r\u00f3wnie\u017c laureata Oscara J.K. Simmonsa i Anne Lambe, ale W SERCU DZICZY to w pe\u0142ni film Brada Pitta, pierwszy od prawie dziesi\u0119ciu lat film, w kt\u00f3rym Pitt wyst\u0119puje w roli g\u0142\u00f3wnej bez licznej obsady drugoplanowej.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY to te\u017c ponowne spotkanie re\u017cysera Davida Ayera z Pittem, kt\u00f3rzy wcze\u015bniej pracowali przy dramacie wojennym FURIA z 2014 roku. Ayer uwa\u017ca jednak, \u017ce w nowym filmie Pitt pokazuje si\u0119 z zupe\u0142nie nowej strony: To prawdziwa bestia. By\u0142 wra\u017cliwy i otworzy\u0142 si\u0119 w spos\u00f3b, jakiego jeszcze nie widzia\u0142em. Ludzie, kt\u00f3rzy obejrzeli film, nieustannie podkre\u015blaj\u0105, jak surowa, wiarygodna i g\u0142\u0119boka jest jego rola.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 15+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: EN<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Heart of the Beast","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"thriller","director":"David Ayer","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5540":{"id":5540,"title":"KURA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kura-2026-10-02-13-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789029344.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T13:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 12:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-10 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 13:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10}]},"event":{"id":990,"name":"KURA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nPozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">G\u0142\u00f3wn\u0105 bohaterk\u0105 nowego filmu w\u0119gierskiego re\u017cysera Gy\u00f6rgya P\u00e1lfiego jest tytu\u0142owa kura. Pozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.  \r\n<br>\r\nTrafia do greckiej nadmorskiej wioski, gdzie schwytana zostaje przez w\u0142a\u015bciciela podupad\u0142ej restauracji i si\u0142\u0105 rzeczy \u201ewchodzi\u201d do ludzkiego \u015bwiata. Jest uwa\u017cn\u0105 obserwatork\u0105 zupe\u0142nie obcej dla niej rzeczywisto\u015bci. Staje si\u0119 te\u017c niemym \u015bwiadkiem ludzkich dramat\u00f3w, zwi\u0105zanych z kryzysem migracyjnym, rodzinnymi konfliktami czy chciwo\u015bci\u0105.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: HU<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Kota","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"komediodramat","director":"Gy\u00f6rgy P\u00e1lfi","organizer":"","country":"W\u0119gierski","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789029344.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5474":{"id":5474,"title":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/luna-i-rozgadana-swinka-2026-09-25-14-00-5","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T15:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 14:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 15:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10}]},"event":{"id":981,"name":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nJedenastoletnia Luna, fanka serii ksi\u0105\u017cek o super-bohaterach walcz\u0105cych o \u015brodowisko, otrzymuje magiczne pi\u00f3ro od tajemniczego autora ksi\u0105\u017cek. \r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Ten zaczarowany przedmiot sprawia, \u017ce wszystko, co napisze, staje si\u0119 rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105. Dziewczynka odkrywa, jak pot\u0119\u017cna jest jego moc i rusza w niebezpieczn\u0105 wypraw\u0119, by naprawi\u0107 szkody wyrz\u0105dzone \u015brodowisku i ocali\u0107 planet\u0119 przed nadci\u0105gaj\u0105c\u0105 katastrof\u0105. Towarzyszy jej Airbag, ukochana \u015bwinka morska, kt\u00f3ra dzi\u0119ki u\u017cyciu pi\u00f3ra nieoczekiwanie zaczyna m\u00f3wi\u0107. Jednak niezwykle nikczemny tw\u00f3rca czarodziejskiego przedmiotu zrobi wszystko, aby ich misja sko\u0144czy\u0142a si\u0119 niepowodzeniem. \u201eLuna i rozgadana \u015bwinka\u201d to pe\u0142na serca i humoru opowie\u015b\u0107 o dojrzewaniu, wyobra\u017ani i odpowiedzialno\u015bci.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 5+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: dubbing<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 88\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"La fille dans les nuages","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"animacja, familijny, przygodow","director":"Philippe Riche","organizer":"","country":"Belgia, Francja","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":88,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5508":{"id":5508,"title":"LALKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-02-17-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T17:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":115,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 16:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-03 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 17:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":110},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":5}]},"event":{"id":989,"name":"LALKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nBogaty warszawski kupiec zakochuje si\u0119 w zubo\u017ca\u0142ej arystokratce.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: PL<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 162\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat obyczajowy, kostiumowy","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5014":{"id":5014,"title":"SBB ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/sbb-2026-10-02-19-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1780389023.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T19:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":296,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 18:00:00","startAt":"2026-06-02 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 19:00:00"},"products":[{"id":10,"name":"BILET NORMALNY","rawPrice":12000,"price":"120,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":87},{"id":18,"name":"BILET NORMALNY \u267f","rawPrice":14000,"price":"140,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":4},{"id":244,"name":"BILET NORMALNY","rawPrice":14000,"price":"140,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":205}]},"event":{"id":940,"name":"SBB ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0.5rem; padding: 0px 0px 10px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.2; text-align: left;\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n\r\nWYDARZENIE ORGANIZATORA ZEWN\u0118TRZNEGO\r\n\r\n<\/span>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n\r\nNajlepszy polski rockowy zesp\u00f3\u0142 wyst\u0105pi w Pszczynie!\r\n\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n\r\nLegenda polskiego rocka wraca na scen\u0119! SBB \u2014 zesp\u00f3\u0142, kt\u00f3ry na zawsze odmieni\u0142 brzmienie rodzimej muzyki \u2014 wyst\u0105pi w Pszczynie z wyj\u0105tkowym koncertem pe\u0142nym energii, wirtuozerii i ponadczasowych d\u017awi\u0119k\u00f3w. To spotkanie z muzyk\u0105, kt\u00f3ra od dekad inspiruje kolejne pokolenia s\u0142uchaczy.\r\n<br><br>\r\nPodczas koncertu us\u0142yszysz kultowe kompozycje, improwizacje, charakterystyczne brzmienia i emocje, kt\u00f3re od lat s\u0105 znakiem rozpoznawczym SBB. To wydarzenie dla tych, kt\u00f3rzy kochaj\u0105 muzyczne podr\u00f3\u017ce, mistrzowskie wykonania i niepowtarzalny klimat koncert\u00f3w na \u017cywo.\r\n<br><br>\r\nPrzyjd\u017a i poczuj si\u0142\u0119 muzyki, kt\u00f3ra nie starzeje si\u0119 nigdy!\r\n\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n__________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n\r\nBilety: 120 \/ 140 PLN (ulgowe \u201310 PLN)\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/th>\r\n\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/koncert-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"Koncert","categoryId":1,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1780389023.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":40,"name":"Sala Widowiskowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5490":{"id":5490,"title":"W SERCU DZICZY ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/w-sercu-dziczy-2026-09-25-20-00-3","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T20:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 19:30:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10}]},"event":{"id":982,"name":"W SERCU DZICZY ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nFilm ukazuj\u0105cy siln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem, a jego wiernym psim towarzyszem.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Brad Pitt i owczarek niemiecki walcz\u0105 o przetrwanie na dzikich terenach Alaski. Po katastrofie lotniczej w samym sercu dzikiej Alaski do\u015bwiadczony by\u0142y \u017co\u0142nierz si\u0142 specjalnych James Belmont (Brad Pitt) i jego pies bojowy Odin, zostaj\u0105 odci\u0119ci od \u015bwiata zdani wy\u0142\u0105cznie na w\u0142asne umiej\u0119tno\u015bci. Razem musz\u0105 stoczy\u0107 walk\u0119 o przetrwanie w obliczu brutalnych si\u0142 natury.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY, film autorstwa uznanego re\u017cysera Davida Ayera, to intensywny thriller przygodowy, kt\u00f3ry ukazuje nierozerwaln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem a jego najlepszym przyjacielem w obliczu ich najwi\u0119kszej jak dot\u0105d bitwy.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW filmie zobaczymy r\u00f3wnie\u017c laureata Oscara J.K. Simmonsa i Anne Lambe, ale W SERCU DZICZY to w pe\u0142ni film Brada Pitta, pierwszy od prawie dziesi\u0119ciu lat film, w kt\u00f3rym Pitt wyst\u0119puje w roli g\u0142\u00f3wnej bez licznej obsady drugoplanowej.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY to te\u017c ponowne spotkanie re\u017cysera Davida Ayera z Pittem, kt\u00f3rzy wcze\u015bniej pracowali przy dramacie wojennym FURIA z 2014 roku. Ayer uwa\u017ca jednak, \u017ce w nowym filmie Pitt pokazuje si\u0119 z zupe\u0142nie nowej strony: To prawdziwa bestia. By\u0142 wra\u017cliwy i otworzy\u0142 si\u0119 w spos\u00f3b, jakiego jeszcze nie widzia\u0142em. Ludzie, kt\u00f3rzy obejrzeli film, nieustannie podkre\u015blaj\u0105, jak surowa, wiarygodna i g\u0142\u0119boka jest jego rola.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 15+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: EN<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Heart of the Beast","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"thriller","director":"David Ayer","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5475":{"id":5475,"title":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/luna-i-rozgadana-swinka-2026-09-25-14-00-6","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","date":"2026-10-03T10:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-03 09:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-03 10:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10}]},"event":{"id":981,"name":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nJedenastoletnia Luna, fanka serii ksi\u0105\u017cek o super-bohaterach walcz\u0105cych o \u015brodowisko, otrzymuje magiczne pi\u00f3ro od tajemniczego autora ksi\u0105\u017cek. \r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Ten zaczarowany przedmiot sprawia, \u017ce wszystko, co napisze, staje si\u0119 rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105. Dziewczynka odkrywa, jak pot\u0119\u017cna jest jego moc i rusza w niebezpieczn\u0105 wypraw\u0119, by naprawi\u0107 szkody wyrz\u0105dzone \u015brodowisku i ocali\u0107 planet\u0119 przed nadci\u0105gaj\u0105c\u0105 katastrof\u0105. Towarzyszy jej Airbag, ukochana \u015bwinka morska, kt\u00f3ra dzi\u0119ki u\u017cyciu pi\u00f3ra nieoczekiwanie zaczyna m\u00f3wi\u0107. Jednak niezwykle nikczemny tw\u00f3rca czarodziejskiego przedmiotu zrobi wszystko, aby ich misja sko\u0144czy\u0142a si\u0119 niepowodzeniem. \u201eLuna i rozgadana \u015bwinka\u201d to pe\u0142na serca i humoru opowie\u015b\u0107 o dojrzewaniu, wyobra\u017ani i odpowiedzialno\u015bci.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 5+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: dubbing<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 88\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"La fille dans les nuages","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"animacja, familijny, przygodow","director":"Philippe Riche","organizer":"","country":"Belgia, Francja","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":88,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5541":{"id":5541,"title":"KURA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kura-2026-10-02-13-00-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789029344.jpg","date":"2026-10-03T13:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-03 12:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-10 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-03 13:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10}]},"event":{"id":990,"name":"KURA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nPozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">G\u0142\u00f3wn\u0105 bohaterk\u0105 nowego filmu w\u0119gierskiego re\u017cysera Gy\u00f6rgya P\u00e1lfiego jest tytu\u0142owa kura. Pozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.  \r\n<br>\r\nTrafia do greckiej nadmorskiej wioski, gdzie schwytana zostaje przez w\u0142a\u015bciciela podupad\u0142ej restauracji i si\u0142\u0105 rzeczy \u201ewchodzi\u201d do ludzkiego \u015bwiata. Jest uwa\u017cn\u0105 obserwatork\u0105 zupe\u0142nie obcej dla niej rzeczywisto\u015bci. Staje si\u0119 te\u017c niemym \u015bwiadkiem ludzkich dramat\u00f3w, zwi\u0105zanych z kryzysem migracyjnym, rodzinnymi konfliktami czy chciwo\u015bci\u0105.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: HU<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Kota","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"komediodramat","director":"Gy\u00f6rgy P\u00e1lfi","organizer":"","country":"W\u0119gierski","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789029344.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5476":{"id":5476,"title":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/luna-i-rozgadana-swinka-2026-09-25-14-00-7","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","date":"2026-10-03T15:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":112,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-03 14:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-03 15:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":0}]},"event":{"id":981,"name":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nJedenastoletnia Luna, fanka serii ksi\u0105\u017cek o super-bohaterach walcz\u0105cych o \u015brodowisko, otrzymuje magiczne pi\u00f3ro od tajemniczego autora ksi\u0105\u017cek. \r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Ten zaczarowany przedmiot sprawia, \u017ce wszystko, co napisze, staje si\u0119 rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105. Dziewczynka odkrywa, jak pot\u0119\u017cna jest jego moc i rusza w niebezpieczn\u0105 wypraw\u0119, by naprawi\u0107 szkody wyrz\u0105dzone \u015brodowisku i ocali\u0107 planet\u0119 przed nadci\u0105gaj\u0105c\u0105 katastrof\u0105. Towarzyszy jej Airbag, ukochana \u015bwinka morska, kt\u00f3ra dzi\u0119ki u\u017cyciu pi\u00f3ra nieoczekiwanie zaczyna m\u00f3wi\u0107. Jednak niezwykle nikczemny tw\u00f3rca czarodziejskiego przedmiotu zrobi wszystko, aby ich misja sko\u0144czy\u0142a si\u0119 niepowodzeniem. \u201eLuna i rozgadana \u015bwinka\u201d to pe\u0142na serca i humoru opowie\u015b\u0107 o dojrzewaniu, wyobra\u017ani i odpowiedzialno\u015bci.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 5+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: dubbing<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 88\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"La fille dans les nuages","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"animacja, familijny, przygodow","director":"Philippe Riche","organizer":"","country":"Belgia, Francja","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":88,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5509":{"id":5509,"title":"LALKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-02-17-00-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","date":"2026-10-03T17:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":112,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-03 16:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-03 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-03 17:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":107},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":5}]},"event":{"id":989,"name":"LALKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nBogaty warszawski kupiec zakochuje si\u0119 w zubo\u017ca\u0142ej arystokratce.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: PL<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 162\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat obyczajowy, kostiumowy","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5611":{"id":5611,"title":"Wojciech Cejrowski i \u201ePrawo D\u017cungli\u201d ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/wojciech-cejrowski-i-prawo-dzungli-2026-10-03-18-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789560394.jpg","date":"2026-10-03T18:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":31,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-03 17:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-16 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-03 18:00:00"},"products":[{"id":10,"name":"BILET NORMALNY","rawPrice":12000,"price":"120,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":31}]},"event":{"id":997,"name":"Wojciech Cejrowski i \u201ePrawo D\u017cungli\u201d ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0.5rem; padding: 0px 0px 10px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.2; text-align: left;\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n\r\nWYDARZENIE ORGANIZATORA ZEWN\u0118TRZNEGO\r\n\r\n<\/span>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n\r\nProsz\u0119 Pa\u0144stwa, w d\u017cungli obowi\u0105zuj\u0105 zasady. K\u0142opot zaczyna si\u0119 wtedy, gdy cz\u0142owiek przyje\u017cd\u017ca tam z w\u0142asnymi.\r\n\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n\r\nWojciech Cejrowski zaprasza na \u201ePrawo D\u017cungli\u201d - wyst\u0119p komediowy pe\u0142en prawdziwych przyg\u00f3d, zaskakuj\u0105cych spostrze\u017ce\u0144 i podr\u00f3\u017cniczych anegdot. B\u0119dzie zabawnie, chwilami zdumiewaj\u0105co, a przy okazji pouczaj\u0105co. Bo z podr\u00f3\u017cy mo\u017cna przywie\u017a\u0107 pami\u0105tki, ale mo\u017cna te\u017c przywie\u017a\u0107 historie, przy kt\u00f3rych ca\u0142a sala wybucha \u015bmiechem.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nNa scenie Cejrowski, mikrofon i opowie\u015bci z miejsc, gdzie nasze codzienne przyzwyczajenia bywaj\u0105 zupe\u0142nie bezu\u017cyteczne. Humor przeplata si\u0119 tu z wiedz\u0105 o \u015bwiecie, a niejedna \u015bmieszna przygoda daje r\u00f3wnie\u017c do my\u015blenia.\r\n<br><br>\r\nZapraszamy Pa\u0144stwa r\u00f3wnie\u017c z dzie\u0107mi - na wsp\u00f3lny wiecz\u00f3r \u015bmiechu, przyg\u00f3d i odkrywania \u015bwiata.\r\n<br><br>\r\nB\u0119dzie tak\u017ce mo\u017cliwo\u015b\u0107 zakupu ksi\u0105\u017cek, zdobycia autografu i zrobienia wsp\u00f3lnego zdj\u0119cia z Wojciechem Cejrowskim.\r\n<br><br>\r\n3 pa\u017adziernika 2026 r. (sobota), godz. 18:00<br>\r\nPszczy\u0144skie Centrum Kultury<br>\r\nul. W\u0142adys\u0142awa Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1, Pszczyna<br>\r\n<br>\r\nBilety: KupBilecik.pl oraz Biletyna.pl<br>\r\n<br>\r\nZapraszamy Pa\u0144stwa do Pszczyny. Do d\u017cungli tym razem pojedziemy opowie\u015bci\u0105 - bez pakowania walizek!\r\n\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n__________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n\r\nBilety: 120 PLN\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/th>\r\n\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kabaret-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"Kabaret","categoryId":5,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789560394.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":40,"name":"Sala Widowiskowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5491":{"id":5491,"title":"W SERCU DZICZY ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/w-sercu-dziczy-2026-09-25-20-00-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","date":"2026-10-03T20:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":119,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-03 19:30:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-03 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":7}]},"event":{"id":982,"name":"W SERCU DZICZY ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nFilm ukazuj\u0105cy siln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem, a jego wiernym psim towarzyszem.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Brad Pitt i owczarek niemiecki walcz\u0105 o przetrwanie na dzikich terenach Alaski. Po katastrofie lotniczej w samym sercu dzikiej Alaski do\u015bwiadczony by\u0142y \u017co\u0142nierz si\u0142 specjalnych James Belmont (Brad Pitt) i jego pies bojowy Odin, zostaj\u0105 odci\u0119ci od \u015bwiata zdani wy\u0142\u0105cznie na w\u0142asne umiej\u0119tno\u015bci. Razem musz\u0105 stoczy\u0107 walk\u0119 o przetrwanie w obliczu brutalnych si\u0142 natury.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY, film autorstwa uznanego re\u017cysera Davida Ayera, to intensywny thriller przygodowy, kt\u00f3ry ukazuje nierozerwaln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem a jego najlepszym przyjacielem w obliczu ich najwi\u0119kszej jak dot\u0105d bitwy.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW filmie zobaczymy r\u00f3wnie\u017c laureata Oscara J.K. Simmonsa i Anne Lambe, ale W SERCU DZICZY to w pe\u0142ni film Brada Pitta, pierwszy od prawie dziesi\u0119ciu lat film, w kt\u00f3rym Pitt wyst\u0119puje w roli g\u0142\u00f3wnej bez licznej obsady drugoplanowej.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY to te\u017c ponowne spotkanie re\u017cysera Davida Ayera z Pittem, kt\u00f3rzy wcze\u015bniej pracowali przy dramacie wojennym FURIA z 2014 roku. Ayer uwa\u017ca jednak, \u017ce w nowym filmie Pitt pokazuje si\u0119 z zupe\u0142nie nowej strony: To prawdziwa bestia. By\u0142 wra\u017cliwy i otworzy\u0142 si\u0119 w spos\u00f3b, jakiego jeszcze nie widzia\u0142em. Ludzie, kt\u00f3rzy obejrzeli film, nieustannie podkre\u015blaj\u0105, jak surowa, wiarygodna i g\u0142\u0119boka jest jego rola.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 15+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: EN<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Heart of the Beast","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"thriller","director":"David Ayer","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5477":{"id":5477,"title":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/luna-i-rozgadana-swinka-2026-09-25-14-00-8","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","date":"2026-10-04T10:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-04 09:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-04 10:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10}]},"event":{"id":981,"name":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nJedenastoletnia Luna, fanka serii ksi\u0105\u017cek o super-bohaterach walcz\u0105cych o \u015brodowisko, otrzymuje magiczne pi\u00f3ro od tajemniczego autora ksi\u0105\u017cek. \r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Ten zaczarowany przedmiot sprawia, \u017ce wszystko, co napisze, staje si\u0119 rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105. Dziewczynka odkrywa, jak pot\u0119\u017cna jest jego moc i rusza w niebezpieczn\u0105 wypraw\u0119, by naprawi\u0107 szkody wyrz\u0105dzone \u015brodowisku i ocali\u0107 planet\u0119 przed nadci\u0105gaj\u0105c\u0105 katastrof\u0105. Towarzyszy jej Airbag, ukochana \u015bwinka morska, kt\u00f3ra dzi\u0119ki u\u017cyciu pi\u00f3ra nieoczekiwanie zaczyna m\u00f3wi\u0107. Jednak niezwykle nikczemny tw\u00f3rca czarodziejskiego przedmiotu zrobi wszystko, aby ich misja sko\u0144czy\u0142a si\u0119 niepowodzeniem. \u201eLuna i rozgadana \u015bwinka\u201d to pe\u0142na serca i humoru opowie\u015b\u0107 o dojrzewaniu, wyobra\u017ani i odpowiedzialno\u015bci.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 5+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: dubbing<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 88\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"La fille dans les nuages","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"animacja, familijny, przygodow","director":"Philippe Riche","organizer":"","country":"Belgia, Francja","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":88,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5542":{"id":5542,"title":"KURA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kura-2026-10-02-13-00-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789029344.jpg","date":"2026-10-04T13:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-04 12:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-10 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-04 13:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10}]},"event":{"id":990,"name":"KURA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nPozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">G\u0142\u00f3wn\u0105 bohaterk\u0105 nowego filmu w\u0119gierskiego re\u017cysera Gy\u00f6rgya P\u00e1lfiego jest tytu\u0142owa kura. Pozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.  \r\n<br>\r\nTrafia do greckiej nadmorskiej wioski, gdzie schwytana zostaje przez w\u0142a\u015bciciela podupad\u0142ej restauracji i si\u0142\u0105 rzeczy \u201ewchodzi\u201d do ludzkiego \u015bwiata. Jest uwa\u017cn\u0105 obserwatork\u0105 zupe\u0142nie obcej dla niej rzeczywisto\u015bci. Staje si\u0119 te\u017c niemym \u015bwiadkiem ludzkich dramat\u00f3w, zwi\u0105zanych z kryzysem migracyjnym, rodzinnymi konfliktami czy chciwo\u015bci\u0105.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: HU<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Kota","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"komediodramat","director":"Gy\u00f6rgy P\u00e1lfi","organizer":"","country":"W\u0119gierski","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789029344.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5478":{"id":5478,"title":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/luna-i-rozgadana-swinka-2026-09-25-14-00-9","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","date":"2026-10-04T15:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-04 14:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-04 15:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10}]},"event":{"id":981,"name":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nJedenastoletnia Luna, fanka serii ksi\u0105\u017cek o super-bohaterach walcz\u0105cych o \u015brodowisko, otrzymuje magiczne pi\u00f3ro od tajemniczego autora ksi\u0105\u017cek. \r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Ten zaczarowany przedmiot sprawia, \u017ce wszystko, co napisze, staje si\u0119 rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105. Dziewczynka odkrywa, jak pot\u0119\u017cna jest jego moc i rusza w niebezpieczn\u0105 wypraw\u0119, by naprawi\u0107 szkody wyrz\u0105dzone \u015brodowisku i ocali\u0107 planet\u0119 przed nadci\u0105gaj\u0105c\u0105 katastrof\u0105. Towarzyszy jej Airbag, ukochana \u015bwinka morska, kt\u00f3ra dzi\u0119ki u\u017cyciu pi\u00f3ra nieoczekiwanie zaczyna m\u00f3wi\u0107. Jednak niezwykle nikczemny tw\u00f3rca czarodziejskiego przedmiotu zrobi wszystko, aby ich misja sko\u0144czy\u0142a si\u0119 niepowodzeniem. \u201eLuna i rozgadana \u015bwinka\u201d to pe\u0142na serca i humoru opowie\u015b\u0107 o dojrzewaniu, wyobra\u017ani i odpowiedzialno\u015bci.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 5+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: dubbing<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 88\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"La fille dans les nuages","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"animacja, familijny, przygodow","director":"Philippe Riche","organizer":"","country":"Belgia, Francja","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":88,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5510":{"id":5510,"title":"LALKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-02-17-00-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","date":"2026-10-04T17:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":109,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-04 16:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-03 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-04 17:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":109},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":0}]},"event":{"id":989,"name":"LALKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nBogaty warszawski kupiec zakochuje si\u0119 w zubo\u017ca\u0142ej arystokratce.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: PL<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 162\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat obyczajowy, kostiumowy","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5492":{"id":5492,"title":"W SERCU DZICZY ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/w-sercu-dziczy-2026-09-25-20-00-5","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","date":"2026-10-04T20:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-04 19:30:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-04 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10}]},"event":{"id":982,"name":"W SERCU DZICZY ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nFilm ukazuj\u0105cy siln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem, a jego wiernym psim towarzyszem.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Brad Pitt i owczarek niemiecki walcz\u0105 o przetrwanie na dzikich terenach Alaski. Po katastrofie lotniczej w samym sercu dzikiej Alaski do\u015bwiadczony by\u0142y \u017co\u0142nierz si\u0142 specjalnych James Belmont (Brad Pitt) i jego pies bojowy Odin, zostaj\u0105 odci\u0119ci od \u015bwiata zdani wy\u0142\u0105cznie na w\u0142asne umiej\u0119tno\u015bci. Razem musz\u0105 stoczy\u0107 walk\u0119 o przetrwanie w obliczu brutalnych si\u0142 natury.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY, film autorstwa uznanego re\u017cysera Davida Ayera, to intensywny thriller przygodowy, kt\u00f3ry ukazuje nierozerwaln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem a jego najlepszym przyjacielem w obliczu ich najwi\u0119kszej jak dot\u0105d bitwy.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW filmie zobaczymy r\u00f3wnie\u017c laureata Oscara J.K. Simmonsa i Anne Lambe, ale W SERCU DZICZY to w pe\u0142ni film Brada Pitta, pierwszy od prawie dziesi\u0119ciu lat film, w kt\u00f3rym Pitt wyst\u0119puje w roli g\u0142\u00f3wnej bez licznej obsady drugoplanowej.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY to te\u017c ponowne spotkanie re\u017cysera Davida Ayera z Pittem, kt\u00f3rzy wcze\u015bniej pracowali przy dramacie wojennym FURIA z 2014 roku. Ayer uwa\u017ca jednak, \u017ce w nowym filmie Pitt pokazuje si\u0119 z zupe\u0142nie nowej strony: To prawdziwa bestia. By\u0142 wra\u017cliwy i otworzy\u0142 si\u0119 w spos\u00f3b, jakiego jeszcze nie widzia\u0142em. Ludzie, kt\u00f3rzy obejrzeli film, nieustannie podkre\u015blaj\u0105, jak surowa, wiarygodna i g\u0142\u0119boka jest jego rola.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 15+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: EN<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Heart of the Beast","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"thriller","director":"David Ayer","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5543":{"id":5543,"title":"KURA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kura-2026-10-05-13-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789029344.jpg","date":"2026-10-05T13:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-05 12:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-10 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-05 13:00:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":990,"name":"KURA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nPozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">G\u0142\u00f3wn\u0105 bohaterk\u0105 nowego filmu w\u0119gierskiego re\u017cysera Gy\u00f6rgya P\u00e1lfiego jest tytu\u0142owa kura. Pozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.  \r\n<br>\r\nTrafia do greckiej nadmorskiej wioski, gdzie schwytana zostaje przez w\u0142a\u015bciciela podupad\u0142ej restauracji i si\u0142\u0105 rzeczy \u201ewchodzi\u201d do ludzkiego \u015bwiata. Jest uwa\u017cn\u0105 obserwatork\u0105 zupe\u0142nie obcej dla niej rzeczywisto\u015bci. Staje si\u0119 te\u017c niemym \u015bwiadkiem ludzkich dramat\u00f3w, zwi\u0105zanych z kryzysem migracyjnym, rodzinnymi konfliktami czy chciwo\u015bci\u0105.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: HU<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Kota","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"komediodramat","director":"Gy\u00f6rgy P\u00e1lfi","organizer":"","country":"W\u0119gierski","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789029344.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5479":{"id":5479,"title":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/luna-i-rozgadana-swinka-2026-09-28-14-00-3","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","date":"2026-10-05T15:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-05 14:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-05 15:00:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":981,"name":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nJedenastoletnia Luna, fanka serii ksi\u0105\u017cek o super-bohaterach walcz\u0105cych o \u015brodowisko, otrzymuje magiczne pi\u00f3ro od tajemniczego autora ksi\u0105\u017cek. \r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Ten zaczarowany przedmiot sprawia, \u017ce wszystko, co napisze, staje si\u0119 rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105. Dziewczynka odkrywa, jak pot\u0119\u017cna jest jego moc i rusza w niebezpieczn\u0105 wypraw\u0119, by naprawi\u0107 szkody wyrz\u0105dzone \u015brodowisku i ocali\u0107 planet\u0119 przed nadci\u0105gaj\u0105c\u0105 katastrof\u0105. Towarzyszy jej Airbag, ukochana \u015bwinka morska, kt\u00f3ra dzi\u0119ki u\u017cyciu pi\u00f3ra nieoczekiwanie zaczyna m\u00f3wi\u0107. Jednak niezwykle nikczemny tw\u00f3rca czarodziejskiego przedmiotu zrobi wszystko, aby ich misja sko\u0144czy\u0142a si\u0119 niepowodzeniem. \u201eLuna i rozgadana \u015bwinka\u201d to pe\u0142na serca i humoru opowie\u015b\u0107 o dojrzewaniu, wyobra\u017ani i odpowiedzialno\u015bci.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 5+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: dubbing<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 88\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"La fille dans les nuages","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"animacja, familijny, przygodow","director":"Philippe Riche","organizer":"","country":"Belgia, Francja","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":88,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5511":{"id":5511,"title":"LALKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-05-17-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","date":"2026-10-05T17:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":116,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-05 16:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-03 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-05 17:00:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":6},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":110}]},"event":{"id":989,"name":"LALKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nBogaty warszawski kupiec zakochuje si\u0119 w zubo\u017ca\u0142ej arystokratce.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: PL<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 162\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat obyczajowy, kostiumowy","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5493":{"id":5493,"title":"W SERCU DZICZY ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/w-sercu-dziczy-2026-09-28-20-00-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","date":"2026-10-05T20:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-05 19:30:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-05 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":982,"name":"W SERCU DZICZY ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nFilm ukazuj\u0105cy siln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem, a jego wiernym psim towarzyszem.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Brad Pitt i owczarek niemiecki walcz\u0105 o przetrwanie na dzikich terenach Alaski. Po katastrofie lotniczej w samym sercu dzikiej Alaski do\u015bwiadczony by\u0142y \u017co\u0142nierz si\u0142 specjalnych James Belmont (Brad Pitt) i jego pies bojowy Odin, zostaj\u0105 odci\u0119ci od \u015bwiata zdani wy\u0142\u0105cznie na w\u0142asne umiej\u0119tno\u015bci. Razem musz\u0105 stoczy\u0107 walk\u0119 o przetrwanie w obliczu brutalnych si\u0142 natury.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY, film autorstwa uznanego re\u017cysera Davida Ayera, to intensywny thriller przygodowy, kt\u00f3ry ukazuje nierozerwaln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem a jego najlepszym przyjacielem w obliczu ich najwi\u0119kszej jak dot\u0105d bitwy.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW filmie zobaczymy r\u00f3wnie\u017c laureata Oscara J.K. Simmonsa i Anne Lambe, ale W SERCU DZICZY to w pe\u0142ni film Brada Pitta, pierwszy od prawie dziesi\u0119ciu lat film, w kt\u00f3rym Pitt wyst\u0119puje w roli g\u0142\u00f3wnej bez licznej obsady drugoplanowej.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY to te\u017c ponowne spotkanie re\u017cysera Davida Ayera z Pittem, kt\u00f3rzy wcze\u015bniej pracowali przy dramacie wojennym FURIA z 2014 roku. Ayer uwa\u017ca jednak, \u017ce w nowym filmie Pitt pokazuje si\u0119 z zupe\u0142nie nowej strony: To prawdziwa bestia. By\u0142 wra\u017cliwy i otworzy\u0142 si\u0119 w spos\u00f3b, jakiego jeszcze nie widzia\u0142em. Ludzie, kt\u00f3rzy obejrzeli film, nieustannie podkre\u015blaj\u0105, jak surowa, wiarygodna i g\u0142\u0119boka jest jego rola.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 15+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: EN<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Heart of the Beast","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"thriller","director":"David Ayer","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5544":{"id":5544,"title":"KURA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kura-2026-10-05-13-00-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789029344.jpg","date":"2026-10-06T13:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-06 12:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-10 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-06 13:00:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":990,"name":"KURA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nPozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">G\u0142\u00f3wn\u0105 bohaterk\u0105 nowego filmu w\u0119gierskiego re\u017cysera Gy\u00f6rgya P\u00e1lfiego jest tytu\u0142owa kura. Pozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.  \r\n<br>\r\nTrafia do greckiej nadmorskiej wioski, gdzie schwytana zostaje przez w\u0142a\u015bciciela podupad\u0142ej restauracji i si\u0142\u0105 rzeczy \u201ewchodzi\u201d do ludzkiego \u015bwiata. Jest uwa\u017cn\u0105 obserwatork\u0105 zupe\u0142nie obcej dla niej rzeczywisto\u015bci. Staje si\u0119 te\u017c niemym \u015bwiadkiem ludzkich dramat\u00f3w, zwi\u0105zanych z kryzysem migracyjnym, rodzinnymi konfliktami czy chciwo\u015bci\u0105.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: HU<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Kota","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"komediodramat","director":"Gy\u00f6rgy P\u00e1lfi","organizer":"","country":"W\u0119gierski","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789029344.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5480":{"id":5480,"title":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/luna-i-rozgadana-swinka-2026-09-28-14-00-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","date":"2026-10-06T15:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-06 14:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-06 15:00:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BIL