font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 5+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: dubbing<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 88\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"La fille dans les nuages","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"animacja, familijny, przygodow","director":"Philippe Riche","organizer":"","country":"Belgia, Francja","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":88,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5512":{"id":5512,"title":"LALKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-05-17-00-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","date":"2026-10-06T17:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":119,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-06 16:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-03 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-06 17:00:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":109}]},"event":{"id":989,"name":"LALKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nBogaty warszawski kupiec zakochuje si\u0119 w zubo\u017ca\u0142ej arystokratce.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: PL<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 162\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat obyczajowy, kostiumowy","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5494":{"id":5494,"title":"W SERCU DZICZY ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/w-sercu-dziczy-2026-09-28-20-00-5","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","date":"2026-10-06T20:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-06 19:30:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-06 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":982,"name":"W SERCU DZICZY ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nFilm ukazuj\u0105cy siln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem, a jego wiernym psim towarzyszem.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Brad Pitt i owczarek niemiecki walcz\u0105 o przetrwanie na dzikich terenach Alaski. Po katastrofie lotniczej w samym sercu dzikiej Alaski do\u015bwiadczony by\u0142y \u017co\u0142nierz si\u0142 specjalnych James Belmont (Brad Pitt) i jego pies bojowy Odin, zostaj\u0105 odci\u0119ci od \u015bwiata zdani wy\u0142\u0105cznie na w\u0142asne umiej\u0119tno\u015bci. Razem musz\u0105 stoczy\u0107 walk\u0119 o przetrwanie w obliczu brutalnych si\u0142 natury.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY, film autorstwa uznanego re\u017cysera Davida Ayera, to intensywny thriller przygodowy, kt\u00f3ry ukazuje nierozerwaln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem a jego najlepszym przyjacielem w obliczu ich najwi\u0119kszej jak dot\u0105d bitwy.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW filmie zobaczymy r\u00f3wnie\u017c laureata Oscara J.K. Simmonsa i Anne Lambe, ale W SERCU DZICZY to w pe\u0142ni film Brada Pitta, pierwszy od prawie dziesi\u0119ciu lat film, w kt\u00f3rym Pitt wyst\u0119puje w roli g\u0142\u00f3wnej bez licznej obsady drugoplanowej.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY to te\u017c ponowne spotkanie re\u017cysera Davida Ayera z Pittem, kt\u00f3rzy wcze\u015bniej pracowali przy dramacie wojennym FURIA z 2014 roku. Ayer uwa\u017ca jednak, \u017ce w nowym filmie Pitt pokazuje si\u0119 z zupe\u0142nie nowej strony: To prawdziwa bestia. By\u0142 wra\u017cliwy i otworzy\u0142 si\u0119 w spos\u00f3b, jakiego jeszcze nie widzia\u0142em. Ludzie, kt\u00f3rzy obejrzeli film, nieustannie podkre\u015blaj\u0105, jak surowa, wiarygodna i g\u0142\u0119boka jest jego rola.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 15+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: EN<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Heart of the Beast","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"thriller","director":"David Ayer","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5545":{"id":5545,"title":"KURA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/kura-2026-10-05-13-00-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789029344.jpg","date":"2026-10-07T13:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-07 12:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-10 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-07 13:00:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":990,"name":"KURA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nPozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">G\u0142\u00f3wn\u0105 bohaterk\u0105 nowego filmu w\u0119gierskiego re\u017cysera Gy\u00f6rgya P\u00e1lfiego jest tytu\u0142owa kura. Pozornie bezbronne zwierz\u0119 ucieka z przemys\u0142owej fermy drobiu w poszukiwaniu bezpiecznego miejsca, by wychowa\u0107 swoje piskl\u0119ta.  \r\n<br>\r\nTrafia do greckiej nadmorskiej wioski, gdzie schwytana zostaje przez w\u0142a\u015bciciela podupad\u0142ej restauracji i si\u0142\u0105 rzeczy \u201ewchodzi\u201d do ludzkiego \u015bwiata. Jest uwa\u017cn\u0105 obserwatork\u0105 zupe\u0142nie obcej dla niej rzeczywisto\u015bci. Staje si\u0119 te\u017c niemym \u015bwiadkiem ludzkich dramat\u00f3w, zwi\u0105zanych z kryzysem migracyjnym, rodzinnymi konfliktami czy chciwo\u015bci\u0105.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: HU<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Kota","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"komediodramat","director":"Gy\u00f6rgy P\u00e1lfi","organizer":"","country":"W\u0119gierski","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789029344.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5481":{"id":5481,"title":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/luna-i-rozgadana-swinka-2026-09-28-14-00-5","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","date":"2026-10-07T15:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-07 14:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-07 15:00:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":981,"name":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nJedenastoletnia Luna, fanka serii ksi\u0105\u017cek o super-bohaterach walcz\u0105cych o \u015brodowisko, otrzymuje magiczne pi\u00f3ro od tajemniczego autora ksi\u0105\u017cek. \r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Ten zaczarowany przedmiot sprawia, \u017ce wszystko, co napisze, staje si\u0119 rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105. Dziewczynka odkrywa, jak pot\u0119\u017cna jest jego moc i rusza w niebezpieczn\u0105 wypraw\u0119, by naprawi\u0107 szkody wyrz\u0105dzone \u015brodowisku i ocali\u0107 planet\u0119 przed nadci\u0105gaj\u0105c\u0105 katastrof\u0105. Towarzyszy jej Airbag, ukochana \u015bwinka morska, kt\u00f3ra dzi\u0119ki u\u017cyciu pi\u00f3ra nieoczekiwanie zaczyna m\u00f3wi\u0107. Jednak niezwykle nikczemny tw\u00f3rca czarodziejskiego przedmiotu zrobi wszystko, aby ich misja sko\u0144czy\u0142a si\u0119 niepowodzeniem. \u201eLuna i rozgadana \u015bwinka\u201d to pe\u0142na serca i humoru opowie\u015b\u0107 o dojrzewaniu, wyobra\u017ani i odpowiedzialno\u015bci.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 5+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: dubbing<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 88\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"La fille dans les nuages","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"animacja, familijny, przygodow","director":"Philippe Riche","organizer":"","country":"Belgia, Francja","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":88,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5513":{"id":5513,"title":"LALKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-05-17-00-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","date":"2026-10-07T17:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-07 16:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-03 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-07 17:00:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":989,"name":"LALKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nBogaty warszawski kupiec zakochuje si\u0119 w zubo\u017ca\u0142ej arystokratce.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: PL<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 162\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat obyczajowy, kostiumowy","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5495":{"id":5495,"title":"W SERCU DZICZY ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/w-sercu-dziczy-2026-09-28-20-00-6","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","date":"2026-10-07T20:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-07 19:30:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-07 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":982,"name":"W SERCU DZICZY ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nFilm ukazuj\u0105cy siln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem, a jego wiernym psim towarzyszem.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Brad Pitt i owczarek niemiecki walcz\u0105 o przetrwanie na dzikich terenach Alaski. Po katastrofie lotniczej w samym sercu dzikiej Alaski do\u015bwiadczony by\u0142y \u017co\u0142nierz si\u0142 specjalnych James Belmont (Brad Pitt) i jego pies bojowy Odin, zostaj\u0105 odci\u0119ci od \u015bwiata zdani wy\u0142\u0105cznie na w\u0142asne umiej\u0119tno\u015bci. Razem musz\u0105 stoczy\u0107 walk\u0119 o przetrwanie w obliczu brutalnych si\u0142 natury.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY, film autorstwa uznanego re\u017cysera Davida Ayera, to intensywny thriller przygodowy, kt\u00f3ry ukazuje nierozerwaln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem a jego najlepszym przyjacielem w obliczu ich najwi\u0119kszej jak dot\u0105d bitwy.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW filmie zobaczymy r\u00f3wnie\u017c laureata Oscara J.K. Simmonsa i Anne Lambe, ale W SERCU DZICZY to w pe\u0142ni film Brada Pitta, pierwszy od prawie dziesi\u0119ciu lat film, w kt\u00f3rym Pitt wyst\u0119puje w roli g\u0142\u00f3wnej bez licznej obsady drugoplanowej.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY to te\u017c ponowne spotkanie re\u017cysera Davida Ayera z Pittem, kt\u00f3rzy wcze\u015bniej pracowali przy dramacie wojennym FURIA z 2014 roku. Ayer uwa\u017ca jednak, \u017ce w nowym filmie Pitt pokazuje si\u0119 z zupe\u0142nie nowej strony: To prawdziwa bestia. By\u0142 wra\u017cliwy i otworzy\u0142 si\u0119 w spos\u00f3b, jakiego jeszcze nie widzia\u0142em. Ludzie, kt\u00f3rzy obejrzeli film, nieustannie podkre\u015blaj\u0105, jak surowa, wiarygodna i g\u0142\u0119boka jest jego rola.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 15+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: EN<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Heart of the Beast","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"thriller","director":"David Ayer","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5547":{"id":5547,"title":"DZIE\u0143 DZIECKA KSI\u0118DZA JANA KACZKOWSKIEGO  - KINO DLA SENIORA","url":"\/kup-bilet\/dzien-dziecka-ksiedza-jana-kaczkowskiego-2026-09-17-13-00-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787563547.jpg","date":"2026-10-08T13:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-08 12:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-24 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-08 13:00:00"},"products":[{"id":256,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1500,"price":"15,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":122}]},"event":{"id":975,"name":"DZIE\u0143 DZIECKA KSI\u0118DZA JANA KACZKOWSKIEGO ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKsi\u0105dz Jan Kaczkowski - charyzmatyczny duchowny i zwyk\u0142y b\u0142\u0105dz\u0105cy cz\u0142owiek.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Naznaczony nieuleczaln\u0105 chorob\u0105, samozwa\u0144czy \"onkocelebryta\", kt\u00f3ry walczy\u0142 dla innych o godno\u015b\u0107 i cz\u0142owiecze\u0144stwo. Dzie\u0144 dziecka - diagnoza choroby, wspomnienia z dzieci\u0144stwa, symboliczne narodzenie dla wieczno\u015bci. Metaforyczny termin, kt\u00f3ry w filmie koncentruje uwag\u0119 na mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107. Na mi\u0142o\u015bci do innych ludzi, chorych i pogubionych, na mi\u0142o\u015bci do rodziny, do ojca i do Boga. To tak\u017ce film o potrzebie kochania i bycia kochanym. Skonstruowany z nieznanych archiwali\u00f3w, prawdziwy portret niezwyk\u0142ego cz\u0142owieka.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 12+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: PL<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 75\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dokument, biograficzny","director":"Artur Wierzbicki","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":75,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787563547.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5482":{"id":5482,"title":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/luna-i-rozgadana-swinka-2026-09-28-14-00-6","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","date":"2026-10-08T15:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-08 14:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-08 15:00:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":981,"name":"LUNA I ROZGADANA \u015aWINKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nJedenastoletnia Luna, fanka serii ksi\u0105\u017cek o super-bohaterach walcz\u0105cych o \u015brodowisko, otrzymuje magiczne pi\u00f3ro od tajemniczego autora ksi\u0105\u017cek. \r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Ten zaczarowany przedmiot sprawia, \u017ce wszystko, co napisze, staje si\u0119 rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105. Dziewczynka odkrywa, jak pot\u0119\u017cna jest jego moc i rusza w niebezpieczn\u0105 wypraw\u0119, by naprawi\u0107 szkody wyrz\u0105dzone \u015brodowisku i ocali\u0107 planet\u0119 przed nadci\u0105gaj\u0105c\u0105 katastrof\u0105. Towarzyszy jej Airbag, ukochana \u015bwinka morska, kt\u00f3ra dzi\u0119ki u\u017cyciu pi\u00f3ra nieoczekiwanie zaczyna m\u00f3wi\u0107. Jednak niezwykle nikczemny tw\u00f3rca czarodziejskiego przedmiotu zrobi wszystko, aby ich misja sko\u0144czy\u0142a si\u0119 niepowodzeniem. \u201eLuna i rozgadana \u015bwinka\u201d to pe\u0142na serca i humoru opowie\u015b\u0107 o dojrzewaniu, wyobra\u017ani i odpowiedzialno\u015bci.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 5+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: dubbing<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 88\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"La fille dans les nuages","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"animacja, familijny, przygodow","director":"Philippe Riche","organizer":"","country":"Belgia, Francja","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":88,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787634246.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5514":{"id":5514,"title":"LALKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-05-17-00-3","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","date":"2026-10-08T17:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-08 16:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-03 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-08 17:00:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":989,"name":"LALKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nBogaty warszawski kupiec zakochuje si\u0119 w zubo\u017ca\u0142ej arystokratce.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: PL<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 162\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat obyczajowy, kostiumowy","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5496":{"id":5496,"title":"W SERCU DZICZY ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/w-sercu-dziczy-2026-09-28-20-00-7","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","date":"2026-10-08T20:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-08 19:30:00","startAt":"2026-08-25 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-08 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":982,"name":"W SERCU DZICZY ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nFilm ukazuj\u0105cy siln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem, a jego wiernym psim towarzyszem.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Brad Pitt i owczarek niemiecki walcz\u0105 o przetrwanie na dzikich terenach Alaski. Po katastrofie lotniczej w samym sercu dzikiej Alaski do\u015bwiadczony by\u0142y \u017co\u0142nierz si\u0142 specjalnych James Belmont (Brad Pitt) i jego pies bojowy Odin, zostaj\u0105 odci\u0119ci od \u015bwiata zdani wy\u0142\u0105cznie na w\u0142asne umiej\u0119tno\u015bci. Razem musz\u0105 stoczy\u0107 walk\u0119 o przetrwanie w obliczu brutalnych si\u0142 natury.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY, film autorstwa uznanego re\u017cysera Davida Ayera, to intensywny thriller przygodowy, kt\u00f3ry ukazuje nierozerwaln\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a mi\u0119dzy cz\u0142owiekiem a jego najlepszym przyjacielem w obliczu ich najwi\u0119kszej jak dot\u0105d bitwy.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW filmie zobaczymy r\u00f3wnie\u017c laureata Oscara J.K. Simmonsa i Anne Lambe, ale W SERCU DZICZY to w pe\u0142ni film Brada Pitta, pierwszy od prawie dziesi\u0119ciu lat film, w kt\u00f3rym Pitt wyst\u0119puje w roli g\u0142\u00f3wnej bez licznej obsady drugoplanowej.\r\n<br><br>\r\nW SERCU DZICZY to te\u017c ponowne spotkanie re\u017cysera Davida Ayera z Pittem, kt\u00f3rzy wcze\u015bniej pracowali przy dramacie wojennym FURIA z 2014 roku. Ayer uwa\u017ca jednak, \u017ce w nowym filmie Pitt pokazuje si\u0119 z zupe\u0142nie nowej strony: To prawdziwa bestia. By\u0142 wra\u017cliwy i otworzy\u0142 si\u0119 w spos\u00f3b, jakiego jeszcze nie widzia\u0142em. Ludzie, kt\u00f3rzy obejrzeli film, nieustannie podkre\u015blaj\u0105, jak surowa, wiarygodna i g\u0142\u0119boka jest jego rola.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 15+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: EN<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 96\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Heart of the Beast","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"thriller","director":"David Ayer","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":96,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1787635688.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5548":{"id":5548,"title":"MARSUPILAMI ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/marsupilami-2026-10-09-14-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/992\/1789456208.jpg","