a, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 12+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: EN<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 95\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Rolling Loud: The Movie","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"komedia, muzyczny","director":"Jeremy Garelick","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":95,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789457476.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5571":{"id":5571,"title":"DIGGER ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/digger-2026-10-09-18-00-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789461931.jpg","date":"2026-10-10T18:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-10 17:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-15 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-10 18:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10}]},"event":{"id":994,"name":"DIGGER ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nMatka Natura? Oooooooooch, ona uwielbia zwyci\u0119zc\u00f3w! DIGGER.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Najpot\u0119\u017cniejszy cz\u0142owiek \u015bwiata wyrusza na desperack\u0105 misj\u0119, by udowodni\u0107, \u017ce jest zbawc\u0105 ludzko\u015bci, zanim katastrofa, kt\u00f3r\u0105 wywo\u0142a\u0142, zniszczy wszystko.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 12+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: EN<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 140\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Digger","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"czarna komedia \/ dramat \/ kino","director":"Alejandro Gonz\u00e1lez I\u00f1\u00e1rritu","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":140,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789461931.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5516":{"id":5516,"title":"LALKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-02-17-00-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","date":"2026-10-10T20:30:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-10 19:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-03 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-10 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10}]},"event":{"id":989,"name":"LALKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nBogaty warszawski kupiec zakochuje si\u0119 w zubo\u017ca\u0142ej arystokratce.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: PL<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 162\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat obyczajowy, kostiumowy","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5551":{"id":5551,"title":"MARSUPILAMI ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/marsupilami-2026-10-09-14-00-3","image":"\/uploads\/event\/992\/1789456208.jpg","date":"2026-10-11T10:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-11 09:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-15 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-11 10:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BI