t&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: PL<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 162\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat obyczajowy, kostiumowy","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5554":{"id":5554,"title":"MARSUPILAMI ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/marsupilami-2026-10-12-14-00-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/992\/1789456208.jpg","date":"2026-10-13T14:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-13 13:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-15 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-13 14:00:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":992,"name":"MARSUPILAMI ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nSzalona, pe\u0142na humoru przygoda, w kt\u00f3rej w centrum akcji znajduje si\u0119 prawdziwy psotnik \u2013 tajemnicze stworzenie MARSUPILAMI!\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Podczas rejsu all-inclusive David, Tess i ich synek odkrywaj\u0105 w swoim baga\u017cu uroczego, \u017c\u00f3\u0142tego stworka w czarne c\u0119tki, kt\u00f3rego niewyobra\u017calnie d\u0142ugi ogon i nieposkromiony temperament w mgnieniu oka zamieniaj\u0105 rodzinne wakacje w totalny chaos \u2013 zw\u0142aszcza gdy okazuje si\u0119, \u017ce nowego przyjaciela ch\u0142opca pr\u00f3buje odnale\u017a\u0107 zdecydowanie zbyt wiele os\u00f3b!\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 6+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: dubbing<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 98\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Marsupilami","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"komedia, familijny","director":"Philippe Lacheau","organizer":"","country":"Francja","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":98,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/992\/1789456208.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"n