_______\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 6+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: dubbing<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 110\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Forgotten Island","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"animacja, familijny","director":"Joel Crawford, Januel Mercado","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":110,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789470259.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"4719":{"id":4719,"title":"MI\u0141O\u015a\u0106 I POLITYKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/milosc-i-polityka-2026-10-25-18-00","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1775115543.jpg","date":"2026-10-25T18:00:00+01:00","availableTickets":62,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-25 17:00:00","startAt":"2026-04-02 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-25 18:00:00"},"products":[{"id":6,"name":"BILET NORMALNY","rawPrice":14000,"price":"140,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":42},{"id":45,"name":"BILET NORMALNY","rawPrice":9000,"price":"90,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":20}]},"event":{"id":896,"name":"MI\u0141O\u015a\u0106 I POLITYKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0.5rem; padding: 0px 0px 10px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.2; text-align: left;\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n\r\nWYDARZENIE ORGANIZATORA ZEWN\u0118TRZNEGO\r\n\r\n<\/span>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n\r\n\u015awiat przedstawiony we francuskiej komedii, to du\u017ce pieni\u0105dze, wp\u0142ywowi ludzie i wielkie tajemnice.\r\n\r\n<\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n\r\nKomedia przenosi widza do miejsca, gdzie mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107, w\u0142adza i pieni\u0105dze stanowi\u0105 stawk\u0119 w nieustannej walce.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nNie brakuje wi\u0119c dynamicznej akcji, zaskakuj\u0105cych wydarze\u0144 i dobrego humoru.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPremier Bertrand Gu\u00e9raud kocha ojczyzn\u0119 i \u017con\u0119, ale jeszcze bardziej rajcuj\u0105 go pieni\u0105dze. By dorobi\u0107 si\u0119 fortuny, prowadzi podejrzane interesy i notorycznie \u0142amie prawo. Przez lata p\u0142awi si\u0119 w luksusach i prowadzi \u017cycie jak z bajki. Nie spodziewa si\u0119, \u017ce w jednej sekundzie ca\u0142y jego \u015bwiat mo\u017ce lec w gruzach.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nA wszystko za spraw\u0105 teczki z kompromituj\u0105cymi go materia\u0142ami, kt\u00f3ra trafi\u0142a w niepowo\u0142ane r\u0119ce. Jak wysok\u0105 cen\u0119 b\u0119dzie w stanie zap\u0142aci\u0107, \u017ceby unikn\u0105\u0107 skandalu? Do czego posunie si\u0119, by prawda nie wysz\u0142a na jaw? Chyba nikt nie spodziewa si\u0119, jak zako\u0144czy si\u0119 ta pe\u0142na zwrot\u00f3w akcji historia.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nZnakomita komedia z plejad\u0105 polskich gwiazd takich jak Melania Grzesiewicz\/Marysia Wieczorek, Anna Oberc, \u0141ukasz Nowicki i Krystian Wieczorek\/Jacek Kr\u00f3l, Jacek Kopczy\u0144ski\/Mariusz Dr\u0119\u017cek ods\u0142ania prawd\u0119 o ludzkich nami\u0119tno\u015bciach i pokazuje, jak \u015bwiat polityki wygl\u0105da od kuchni. A przy tym \u2013 bawi do \u0142ez.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkandalem by\u0142oby jej nie zobaczy\u0107!\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n\r\nkomedia teatralna Pierre\u2019a Sauvilla<br>\r\n<br>\r\nre\u017cyseria: Anna Oberc<br>\r\n<br>\r\nprzek\u0142ad: Barbara Grzegorzewska<br>\r\n<br>\r\nscenografia: Witek Stefaniak\r\n\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n__________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n\r\nBilety: 90 \/ 140 PLN\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/th>\r\n\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/spektakl-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"","year":"","category":"Spektakl","categoryId":4,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1775115543.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":40,"name":"Sala Widowiskowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5628":{"id":5628,"title":"INNA MAMUSIA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/inna-mamusia-2026-10-23-18-00-2","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789741073.jpg","date":"2026-10-25T18:00:00+01:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-25 17:00:00","startAt":"2026-09-18 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-25 18:00:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10}]},"event":{"id":999,"name":"INNA MAMUSIA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nO\u015bmioletnia Bela zaczyna dostrzega\u0107 w swoim domu tajemnicz\u0105 obecno\u015b\u0107.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Istota, kt\u00f3ra coraz cz\u0119\u015bciej pojawia si\u0119 w jej otoczeniu, wygl\u0105da niemal identycznie jak jej ukochana mama. Dziewczynka nawi\u0105zuje z ni\u0105 niezwyk\u0142\u0105 wi\u0119\u017a, nie zdaj\u0105c sobie sprawy, \u017ce za znajom\u0105 twarz\u0105 kryje si\u0119 co\u015b niewyobra\u017calnie mrocznego.\r\n<br>\r\nGdy granica mi\u0119dzy rzeczywisto\u015bci\u0105 a koszmarem zaczyna si\u0119 zaciera\u0107, rodzina Beli staje w obliczu przera\u017caj\u0105cej prawdy.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 15+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: EN<br>\r\nNapisy: PL<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 90\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Other Mommy","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"horror","director":"Rob Savage","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":90,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789741073.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5531":{"id":5531,"title":"LALKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-02-17-00-6-3","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","date":"2026-10-25T20:30:00+01:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-25 19:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-03 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-25 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10}]},"event":{"id":989,"name":"LALKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nBogaty warszawski kupiec zakochuje si\u0119 w zubo\u017ca\u0142ej arystokratce.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: PL<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 162\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat obyczajowy, kostiumowy","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5607":{"id":5607,"title":"SUPERMOCNI ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/supermocni-2026-10-26-13-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789472127.jpg","date":"2026-10-26T13:30:00+01:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-26 12:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-15 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-26 13:30:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":996,"name":"SUPERMOCNI ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nGdy \u015bwiat jest w niebezpiecze\u0144stwie, tylko SUPERMOCNI mog\u0105 go ocali\u0107.\r\n\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Zo\u015bka jest troch\u0119 zwariowan\u0105 nastolatk\u0105, kt\u00f3ra najbardziej na \u015bwiecie kocha swoje zwierzaki. Gdy pewnego dnia, w naukowym laboratorium jej mamy, dochodzi do ma\u0142ej demolki, a Zo\u015bka i zwierzaki stykaj\u0105 si\u0119 z tajemnicz\u0105 kosmiczn\u0105 substancj\u0105, \u017cycie ca\u0142ej rodziny staje na g\u0142owie! Dziewczynka i jej pupile zaczynaj\u0105 si\u0119 dziwnie zmienia\u0107. Ona staje si\u0119 bardziej dzika i zwinna, a futrzaki bardziej bystre i wygadane. Z jednej strony to \u015bwietna sprawa, bo wszyscy zyskuj\u0105 niesamowite moce, ale z drugiej, je\u015bli tak dalej p\u00f3jdzie, Zo\u015bka ca\u0142kiem zmieni si\u0119 w zwierzaka, a zwierzaki w ludzi. Zosta\u0142 im tylko jeden dzie\u0144 na odwr\u00f3cenie tej dziwnej mutacji. Ale to nie jedyny problem. Ot\u00f3\u017c pewien \u017c\u0105dny w\u0142adzy naukowiec chce za pomoc\u0105 owej kosmicznej substancji przej\u0105\u0107 panowanie nad \u015bwiatem. Je\u015bli wpadnie ona w jego \u0142apy, na ratunek b\u0119dzie za p\u00f3\u017ano. Zo\u015bka i jej zwierzaki musz\u0105 zapanowa\u0107 nad swoimi super mocami i wykorzysta\u0107 je do ratowania planety.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 6+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: dubbing<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 94\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Evolution","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"komedia, animacja","director":"JJulio Soto Gurpide, Zayra Munoz Dominguez","organizer":"","country":"Hiszpania","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":94,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789472127.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5599":{"id":5599,"title":"ZAPOMNIANA WYSPA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/zapomniana-wyspa-2026-10-19-13-00-3","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789470259.jpg","date":"2026-10-26T15:30:00+01:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-26 14:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-15 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-26 15:30:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":995,"name":"ZAPOMNIANA WYSPA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nPrzyja\u017a\u0144 mi\u0119dzy pe\u0142n\u0105 werwy i \u017c\u0105dn\u0105 przyg\u00f3d Jo, a odpowiedzialn\u0105 i rozs\u0105dn\u0105 Raiss\u0105, trwa od szko\u0142y podstawowej.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">W ko\u0144cu staj\u0105 u progu doros\u0142o\u015bci, a Raissa wyje\u017cd\u017ca na studia. Po\u017cegnalny wiecz\u00f3r zamienia si\u0119 w niezwyk\u0142\u0105 podr\u00f3\u017c. Za spraw\u0105 tajemniczego portalu trafiaj\u0105 na legendarn\u0105 wysp\u0119 Nakali, 