se,"available":107}]},"event":{"id":1000,"name":"MISTYCZKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nS\u0105 takie spotkania, po kt\u00f3rych wracamy do swojego \u017cycia i wszystko toczy si\u0119 dalej.S\u0105 te\u017c takie, po kt\u00f3rych nic ju\u017c nie jest takie samo.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Dla Alicji Lenczewskiej takim momentem by\u0142y rekolekcje w Gostyniu. Mia\u0142a 51 lat. Za sob\u0105 lata pracy nauczycielki, podr\u00f3\u017ce, w\u0142asne plany i \u017cycie, kt\u00f3re \u2013 mog\u0142oby si\u0119 wydawa\u0107 \u2013 mia\u0142o ju\u017c wyznaczony kierunek.\r\n<br><br>\r\nA jednak w\u0142a\u015bnie wtedy wszystko si\u0119 zmieni\u0142o.\r\n<br><br>\r\nRozpocz\u0119\u0142a si\u0119 droga, kt\u00f3rej Alicja wcze\u015bniej nie mog\u0142a przewidzie\u0107. Droga g\u0142\u0119bokiej przemiany, poszukiwania Boga i do\u015bwiadcze\u0144, kt\u00f3re przez kolejne lata skrupulatnie zapisywa\u0142a w swoich dziennikach. Dzi\u015b te s\u0142owa dotykaj\u0105 serc tysi\u0119cy ludzi.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 12+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: PL<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 86\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Mistyczka","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"","director":"","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":86,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789747754.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5535":{"id":5535,"title":"LALKA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-05-17-00-4-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","date":"2026-10-29T20:30:00+01:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-29 19:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-03 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-29 20:30:00"},"products":[{"id":27,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10},{"id":36,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":1999,"price":"19,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112}]},"event":{"id":989,"name":"LALKA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nBogaty warszawski kupiec zakochuje si\u0119 w zubo\u017ca\u0142ej arystokratce.\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (Marcin Doroci\u0144ski) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (Kamila Urz\u0119dowska). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (Marek Kondrat), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 13+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: PL<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 162\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"dramat obyczajowy, kostiumowy","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":162,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788436558.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5642":{"id":5642,"title":"BARANEK SHAUN I KUD\u0141ATA BESTIA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/baranek-shaun-i-kudlata-bestia-2026-10-30-13-30","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789748734.jpg","date":"2026-10-30T13:30:00+01:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-30 12:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-18 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-30 13:30:00"},"products":[{"id":1,"name":"BILET STANDARD","rawPrice":2299,"price":"22,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":112},{"id":48,"name":"BILET VIP","rawPrice":2599,"price":"25,99","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":10}]},"event":{"id":1001,"name":"BARANEK SHAUN I KUD\u0141ATA BESTIA ","description":"<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; color: black; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nW\u0142os (i we\u0142na) zje\u017cy Wam si\u0119 na g\u0142owie!\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">Zbierzcie swoje stado, bo nadci\u0105ga \u201eBaranek Shaun i Kud\u0142ata Bestia\u201d! Zobacz zwiastun najnowszego filmu z uwielbianej serii, kt\u00f3ry czyta nie kto inny, tylko sam Szymon Majewski! W tej przezabawnej kinowej przygodzie najs\u0142ynniejszy baranek \u015bwiata zamienia si\u0119 w\u2026 szalonego naukowca. Co mo\u017ce p\u00f3j\u015b\u0107 nie tak?<br><br>\r\nW wiecz\u00f3r Halloween na farmie Mossy Bottom ekscytacja przeradza si\u0119 w przera\u017cenie, gdy niezdarny Farmer niszczy pole dyniowe. Shaun pr\u00f3buje naprawi\u0107 to za pomoc\u0105 eksperyment\u00f3w naukowych, ale sytuacja wymyka si\u0119 spod kontroli, gdy w lesie pojawia si\u0119 dzika bestia...\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n    __________\r\n<\/span>\r\n<br>\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(10, 10, 10); font-family: &quot;calibri light&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Lucida, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nKATEGORIA WIEKOWA: 6+<br>\r\nJ\u0119zyk: dubbing<br>\r\nNapisy: \u2212\u2212\u2212<br>\r\nCzas trwania: 80\"\r\n<\/span>\r\n<\/th>\r\n<th style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\r\n<img src=\"https:\/\/pckul.pl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/kino-color.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">\r\n<\/th>\r\n<\/tr>\r\n<\/tbody>\r\n<\/table>","oryginal_title":"Shaun the Sheep: The Beast of Mossy Bottom","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"animacja, familijny, przygodow","director":"Steve Cox, Matthew Walker","organizer":"","country":"UK","year":"2026","category":"Kino","categoryId":2,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":80,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789748734.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":38,"name":"KINO","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Pszczyna","city_id":1587,"zip":"43-200","addresse":"ul. W. Jagie\u0142\u0142y 1"}},"5633":{"id":5633,"title":"INNA MAMUSIA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/inna-mamusia-2026-10-23-18-00-4","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1789741073.jpg","date":"2026-10-30T18:00:00+01:00","availableTickets":122,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endA